#. macro: <if ($n1 < $n2)>Gather <noun-en Item 3 $n5 2 1> at the Elysian playgrounds.<else>Deliver <noun-en Item 2 $n5 2 1> to the soil purification unit.</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 < number parameter 2 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($n4 == 18)><if ($n1 < $n2)>Catch <noun-en Item 1 $n5 1 1> at the Elysian playgrounds.<else>Deliver <noun-en Item 2 $n5 1 1> to the soil purification unit.<… — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 4 == 18 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($n1 < $n2)>Catch <noun-en Item 1 $n5 1 1> at the Elysian playgrounds.<else>Deliver <noun-en Item 2 $n5 1 1> to the soil purification unit.</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 < number parameter 2 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
